---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---

<Base title="Nicolas Robinet">
  <section class="page" id="home" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">As evening settles in</p>
    <h2 class="page-title page-title--hero" id="home-title">A quiet place<br />to build things.</h2>
    <p class="lede">Freelance full-stack developer. I write software the way you watch a sunset, patiently, and with a little wonder at how the pieces fall into place.</p>

    <Divider />

    <p class="prose">I am <span class="hl">Nicolas Robinet</span>, a developer who loves the quiet satisfaction of a thing that simply works. I take on client projects end to end, from the first empty repository to the calm of a clean deploy at the end of a long day.</p>
    <p class="prose">Lately I am wandering into the clouds, learning Kubernetes, Docker, and the quiet art of infrastructure that looks after itself. And always, happily, a gamer at heart.</p>

    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="/projects">
        <span class="card__label">Selected work</span>
        <span class="card__row"><span class="card__title">Explore my work</span><span class="card__more">see them &#8594;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/journal">
        <span class="card__label">From the journal</span>
        <span class="card__row"><span class="card__title">Read the journal</span><span class="card__more">read &#8594;</span></span>
      </a>
      <div class="card card--static">
        <span class="card__label">Currently studying</span>
        <span class="card__row"><span class="card__title card__title--muted">AWS &middot; Kubernetes &middot; Docker</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
